{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489963146838017","content":"Probably the happiest place aboard the boat, Helga’s Mandatory Recreation is mandatory for all personnel. A fit body makes for a sharp mind, to the Gnomish way of thinking. The Spa also contains an electric eel sensory deprivation chamber that opens to reveal a smugglers hold that is private to the OoK.","created_at":"2020-07-25T07:49:53.510000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736490395051098174","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MoogleLogic","id":"402542822797869057","is_bot":0,"username":"mooglelogic"},"author_id":"402542822797869057","channel_id":"736489963146838017","content":"Johann, worn out from a long day's work, walks along the quieter halls towards helga's. He heads inside and takes a quick shower, then wraps up in a towel and enters the sauna. Spooning some water over the hot coals, he sighs and enjoys the steam (let me know if none of this exists, happy to delete. Has been a long working Sunday for me and dreaming of sauna)","created_at":"2020-07-27T02:44:37.243000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-27T02:49:37.979000Z","id":"737138346790354984","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
